WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary digest v1.0 — planetary-digest (zu) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:14.659
<v Narrator>Siyavuyisana nawe ku-OpenIE Research Radio Planetary Digest, esichaza ngezinhlamvu izifundo ezingu-29 zokufinyelela ngokuvulekile ekuqinisekisweni, ukubalwa kwezimali kokusebenza.

2
00:00:14.739 --> 00:00:36.627
<v Narrator>Ngohlelo lwethu lwesigaba esi-4 sokuhlola-kuqala, amathebulethi wesikhathi esiqhubekayo se-hash, izibalo zokusesha ze-trigram, kanye nenani eliphelele lokuxazulula ukuphatha imibuzo ejwayelekile yasekhaya, ukuvula imodeli enkulu ye-neural kuphela njengendawo yokugcina.

3
00:00:36.707 --> 00:01:04.395
<v Narrator>On inline 5-volt board shunts nge 0.09 kuya ku-0.11 percent idle drift, unpacking 0.1517 bits-per-ubunzima matricses emuva 32-bit floats wasted 81.86 izikhathi eziningi ibhodi amandla kunazo zonke 8-bit integers, ngenkathi ephaketheni integer logic wakhuphuka 187.49 microjoules gross futhi ukucisha kabanzi cascade amandla 26.58 izikhathi.

4
00:01:04.475 --> 00:01:21.790
<v Narrator>Ucwaningo lonke luhamba nge-cryptographic hashes, 6-fabric cross-architecture determinism, 24-kilobit Opus low-bandwidth feeds, ukucaciswa okubanzi kwesandi, kanye neCreative Commons Zero plain-language summaries.
